# Native Settings > Apps for the board's screen (owner decisions 2026-11-01): the Available list shows only the apps whose
# registry min_size fits the logical landscape canvas (no hint row for the hidden ones; Installed is never filtered), and
# an app's page carries two read-only rows before the Description: Screen ("Landscape", "Landscape and portrait") and
# Minimum size. Fixtures: tests/render/fixtures/apps-cache (registry cache: Bench Tools 640x480 + portrait 480x640,
# Signal Meter 480x320 landscape only, Pocket Ruler no field, Weather Station 800x480; Packet Radar says 320x170 there but
# its installed .desktop in fixtures/apps-root says 640x480 + X-Portrait 480x640 and wins) on the fake catalogue with
# `env HARNESS_APPS_DESC on`. 480x320 hides Bench Tools; the other sizes list all three. Review only, no golden.
# Highlighted (centre) row: 480x320 y 180, 640x480 y 267, 800x480 y 268, 720x720 y 392, 1280x720 y 391.
title settings native apps screen filter
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
env HARNESS_APPS catalogue
env HARNESS_APPS_DESC on
env HARNESS_APPS_NEEDS on
env M5APPSTORE_STATE_DIR /nonexistent/harness-appstore
keyboards 1
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 3000
# Available
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 500
shot compat_avail_list
@480x320 expect_rows "Pocket Ruler" "Signal Meter"
@640x480,800x480,720x720,1280x720 expect_rows "Bench Tools" "Pocket Ruler" "Signal Meter"
# Bench Tools (not at 480x320): Screen, Minimum size, Description, Install, Cancel; the highlight starts on Description
@640x480,800x480,720x720,1280x720 key ENTER
wait 500
@640x480,800x480,720x720,1280x720 shot compat_page_both
@640x480,800x480,720x720,1280x720 expect_rows Screen "Minimum size" Description Install Cancel
@640x480,800x480,720x720,1280x720 key ESC
wait 500
# Pocket Ruler: no fields and no description: Install, Cancel only
@480x320 key ENTER
@640x480,800x480,720x720,1280x720 key DOWN
@640x480,800x480,720x720,1280x720 key ENTER
wait 500
shot compat_page_none
expect_rows Install Cancel
key ESC
wait 500
# Signal Meter: landscape only
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 500
shot compat_page_landscape
expect_rows Screen "Minimum size" Description Install Cancel
key ESC
wait 500
# the root: Available (2) at 480x320, Available (3) elsewhere
key ESC
wait 500
shot compat_root
# Installed: never filtered. Packet Radar (facts from its .desktop), Weather Station (registry fallback), Field Notes (none)
key UP
key ENTER
wait 500
shot compat_installed
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 500
shot compat_installed_page_both
expect_rows Screen "Minimum size" Description Update Remove Cancel
key ESC
wait 500
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 500
shot compat_installed_page_landscape
expect_rows Screen "Minimum size" Update Remove Cancel
key ESC
wait 500
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 500
shot compat_installed_page_none
expect_rows Description Remove Cancel
